; start step that sits in the outer header with no load beside it is left in
; stage 1 by that collection. collectDerivedPointerUpdates then promotes the
; pointer-update chain that feeds the inner-loop header PHI, when the chain is
; rooted at an outer header PHI or at a stage-0 pointer.
;
; A loop-carried stride whose base is only the outer header PHI is not an
; inner start step, and stays in stage 1.

